{"numberOfHits":1,"results":[{"id":"GO:0010483","isObsolete":false,"name":"pollen tube reception","definition":{"text":"An interaction between the pollen tube, part of the male gametophyte, and the female gametophyte (typically the synergid cells), that results in the arrest of pollen tube growth, rupture of the pollen tube and the release of the sperm cells.","xrefs":[{"dbCode":"PMID","dbId":"37640641"}]},"history":[{"timestamp":"2024-05-30","action":"Added","category":"DEFINITION","text":"An interaction between the pollen tube, part of the male gametophyte, and the female gametophyte (typically the synergid cells), that results in the arrest of pollen tube growth, rupture of the pollen tube and the release of the sperm cells."},{"timestamp":"2024-05-30","action":"Deleted","category":"DEFINITION","text":"Interaction between the pollen tube, part of the male gametophyte, and the ovule, part of the female gametophyte, that results in the arrest of pollen tube growth, rupture of the pollen tube and the release of the sperm cells."},{"timestamp":"2024-03-05","action":"Added","category":"CONSTRAINT","text":"Bad taxon ID"},{"timestamp":"2024-02-24","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0022414 (reproductive process)"},{"timestamp":"2020-02-22","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0022414 (reproductive process)"},{"timestamp":"2020-02-22","action":"Deleted","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044703 (multi-organism reproductive process)"},{"timestamp":"2015-11-21","action":"Added","category":"RELATION","text":"is a GO:0044703 (multi-organism reproductive process)"},{"timestamp":"2008-05-13","action":"Added","category":"DEFINITION","text":"Interaction between the pollen tube, part of the male gametophyte, and the ovule, part of the female gametophyte, that results in the arrest of pollen tube growth, rupture of the pollen tube and the release of the sperm cells."},{"timestamp":"2008-05-12","action":"Deleted","category":"DEFINITION","